content.text:
The final 16:9 batch is running. ZEROSTER (Valheim, English) is first, and the 10 videos will take about 25–30 min in total, one at a time at 1080p60. I'm watching the output folder and will check every video frame by frame as it lands.

While the batch runs I've written:
- [README.md](nxeon-creator-promo/README.md), covering how to add creators, re-render, change copy or timing, and add games or languages;
- `tools/creator-kit.mjs`, which drops a `HOW-TO-USE.txt` next to each creator's videos, with a timed narration script, YouTube paid-promotion instructions and ready-to-paste description text, plus an end-frame PNG per video;
- the transparent overlay kit (logo sting, code lower-third, end card) as separate compositions, to be render-tested once the batch finishes.

I'll report back when all 10 are done and verified.

