## 4. Render contract

Render one video (Linux, from the template dir):

```bash
npx --yes hyperframes@0.8.140 render --quiet --strict-variables \
  --variables-file /tmp/vars.json -f 60 -q high -o /path/out.mp4            # 16:9
# 9:16: add   --composition compositions/vertical.html
